{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00838","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 羣臣酒行歌 二 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 羣臣酒行歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国咸归禹，千官共祝尧。\n拜恩瞻凤扆，倾耳听云韶。\n运啓金行远，时和玉烛调。\n酒酣齐拚舞，同贺圣明朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}